<section class="section-content read-more-cont" id="travel-ins"> 
    <div class="container">
        <div class="img-cont-sec">
            <div class="cont-sec">
                <h1 class="heading1">Travel Insurance</h1>
                <p class="text">Travel plans don’t always go as expected. From medical emergencies and trip disruptions to lost baggage and passport loss, travel insurance helps protect you from unexpected expenses and inconveniences, so you can travel with greater confidence and peace of mind.</p>
                <p class="text mt-20">Whether you're travelling abroad for leisure, business, or education, ICICI Lombard Travel Insurance offers coverage for a wide range of travel-related risks. You can also enhance your protection with add-ons for adventure sports, pre-existing diseases, and more, helping you enjoy your journey without unnecessary worries.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="img-sec">
                <figure>
                    <img src="/docs/default-source/assets/marketing/images/travel-insu.webp" alt="Travel Insurance - Secure Your Trip With Travel Insurance" title="Travel Insurance - Secure Your Trip With Travel Insurance" class="img-right-pos">
                </figure>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section-content read-more-cont" id="what-travel">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="cont-img-sec">
            <div class="img-sec">
                <img src="/docs/default-source/assets/marketing/images/what-travel-ins.webp" alt="Travel Insurance - Pack Your Travel Safety" title="Travel Insurance - Pack Your Travel Safety">
            </div>
            <div class="cont-sec">
                <h2 class="heading2">What is Travel Insurance?</h2>
                <p class="text">Travel insurance is your safety net against unexpected situations during your trip abroad. Medical emergencies, lost baggage or delayed flight delays can happen without warning and dealing with them can be stressful and costly. Choosing the best travel insurance policy can help you stay prepared and travel worry-free. It is also mandatory requirement in many countries, including the Schengen countries, Cuba and Russia.</p>
                <div class="more-list more-cont">
                    <p class="text mt-15"><strong>Our travel insurance policy covers you for:</strong></p>
                    <ul>
                        <li class="mt-10"><p class="text">Medical Emergencies<sup>I</sup>: Get coverage for your emergency hospitalisation expenses.</p></li>
                        <li class="mt-10"><p class="text">Passport Loss<sup>M</sup>: Get help and reimbursement if you lose your passport aboard.</p></li>
                        <li class="mt-10"><p class="text">Trip Cancellation Due to Visa Rejection<sup>V</sup>: Get reimbursed for non-refundable expenses or cancellation charges.</p></li>
                        <li class="mt-10"><p class="text">Flight Delays<sup>W</sup>: Get fixed payout in case of extended flight delays.</p></li>
                        <li class="mt-10"><p class="text">Lost/Delayed Baggage<sup>D</sup>: Get coverage when your checked-in luggage is lost/delayed by the airline.</p></li>
                        <li class="mt-10"><p class="text">Trip Cancellation<sup>K</sup>: Get reimbursement if you need to cancel your trip due to events like medical emergency, natural disasters, etc.</p></li>
                        <li class="mt-10"><p class="text">Missed Connecting Flight<sup>X</sup>: Get cover for extra costs if a delay makes you miss your next flight.</p></li>
                        <li class="mt-10"><p class="text">Trip Interruption &amp; Curtailment<sup>Y</sup>: Get support if you need to cut your trip short due to unexpected events.</p></li>
                        <li class="mt-10"><p class="text">Adventure Sports<sup>Q</sup>: Enjoy coverage for thrill-based activities like skiing and skydiving.</p></li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <a href="javascript:;" class="r-more mt-20">Read more</a>   
                <p class="text mt-15"><strong>You can also customise your coverage based on your need when you buy travel insurance from India.</strong></p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section-content quick-sum-block" id="ai-quick-sum">
    <div class="container quick-block">
        <div class="flex-block">
            <img src="/docs/default-source/assets/product-bundle/il-travel/images/ai.webp" alt="Quick Summary" title="Quick Summary">
            <h2 class="heading2 align-center">Quick Summary</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="arrow-list mt-40">
            <ul class="list list2">
                <li class="list-item"><p>Travel insurance helps protect you against unexpected medical and travel-related expenses during your international trip. </p></li>
                <li class="list-item"><p>Coverage typically includes medical emergencies, hospitalisation, trip delays, passport loss, loss of checked-in baggage, and personal accident benefits, as per policy terms.</p></li>
                <li class="list-item"><p>You can choose from a range of plans, including Single Trip, Multi-Trip, and Student Travel Insurance, based on your travel needs.</p></li>
                <li class="list-item"><p>Enhance your coverage with add-ons such as Adventure Sports Cover, Pre-Existing Disease Cover (in life-threatening situations), and Electronic Equipment Loss Cover.</p></li>
                <li class="list-item"><p>Travel insurance is a mandatory requirement for entry into several countries and can also support visa applications where applicable.</p></li>
                <li class="list-item"><p>Your travel insurance premium is determined by factors such as destination, trip duration, traveller's age, sum insured, number of travellers, and selected add-ons.</p></li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section-content table-block bg-pink-linear" id="key-featu">
    <div class="container">
        <h2 class="heading2 align-center">Key Features of ICICI Lombard Travel Insurance</h2>
        <p class="text align-center mt-15 width-auto middle-width">ICICI Lombard offers travel insurance policies specifically designed for today’s travellers – with smart features that help you travel worry-free. Have a look at some of our key features:</p>

        <div class="table-wrapper table-auto table-style mt-30">
            <table class="table-wrap">
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>Key Features</th>
                        <th class="no-right-border">Benefits</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    <tr>
                        <td>Premium </td>
                        <td class="no-right-border">You can buy our travel insurance policy for a premium starting at just ₹20/day<sup>S</sup> (with zero GST). </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>Wide Coverage </td>
                        <td class="no-right-border">We cover a wide range of travel-related risks to protect you and your loved ones on your international trip. </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>High Sum Insured </td>
                        <td class="no-right-border">Enjoy high sum insured of up to $5,000,000 for complete peace of mind. </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>Coverage Duration </td>
                        <td class="no-right-border">You choose a cover for up to one year with our multi-trip plans – ideal for frequent travellers. </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>Coverage Customisation </td>
                        <td class="no-right-border">You can opt for our amazing add-ons like Adventure Sports Cover<sup>Q</sup>, Pre-existing Disease Cover<sup>O</sup> and more. </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>No Medical Test Required </td>
                        <td class="no-right-border">No medical tests, no delays. It’s that simple. </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>Quick Policy Purchase </td>
                        <td class="no-right-border">Just buy travel insurance online within minutes and start packing for your dream trip. </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>COVID-19 Coverage </td>
                        <td class="no-right-border">Get covered for hospitalisation expenses due to COVID-19 while travelling abroad. </td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td class="no-bottom-border">Customer Support </td>
                        <td class="no-right-border no-bottom-border">Get 24x7 assistance whenever you’re stuck. </td>
                    </tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>
        <p class="text align-center mt-30 width-auto note-txt middle-width"><strong>So, what are you waiting for? Secure your upcoming international trip with our travel insurance policy and stay prepared for the unexpected travel and medical emergencies abroad.</strong></p>
    </div> 
</section>

<section class="section-content bg-gray-linear" id="types-travel">
    <div class="container">
        <h2 class="heading2 align-center">Types of Travel Insurance</h2>

        <div class="tab-category">
            <div class="tab-sec">
                <ul>
                    <li class="active tab-list" id="trip"><span>Trip type</span></li>
                    <li id="travellers" class="tab-list"><span>Travellers</span></li>
                    <li id="coverage" class="tab-list"><span>Coverage</span></li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="tab-data">
                <div class="col-wrap owl-carousel owl-theme owl-sec mt-30 tab-cont" data-rel="trip">
                    <div class="col-item">
                        <img src="/docs/default-source/assets/marketing/images/single-trip.webp" alt="Single Trip Travel Insurance" title="Single Trip Travel Insurance">
                        <div class="col-content">
                            <h3 class="heading3">Single Trip Travel<br> Insurance </h3>
                            <ul class="type-list">
                                <li class="type-item"><p class="text">Covers individuals/families</p></li>
                                <li class="type-item"><p class="text">Ideal for vacations, business trips or short-term travel </p></li>
