<section class="section-content bg-warmgray" id="doc-require">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="img-list-block flex-div">
           
            <div class="list-block left-block org-list width-50">
                <h2 class="heading2">What are the Documents Required to Buy Travel Insurance? </h2>
                <p class="text">You can easily buy travel insurance online by providing some basic details. These include: </p>
                <ul class="mt-15">
                    <li class="text"><strong>Personal Details:</strong> Share your personal details like your name, age, date of birth, contact information and nominee details</li>
                    <li class="text"><strong>Travel Details:</strong> Provide details related to your international trip, including destination, travel dates and duration. </li>
                    <li class="text"><strong>Government ID:</strong> Submit your identity proof documents like Aadhaar Card/PAN card and Passport. </li>
                </ul>
                <p class="text strong-txt mt-20">You can also refer to our travel insurance <a href="/docs/default-source/default-document-library/trip-secure-plus-calculator_v14-2.xlsb?ver=210826" class="link" target="_blank">rate chart.</a></p>
            </div>
