            <div class="col-xs-12 text-center">
                <div class="owl-carousel owl-theme ui-reviews-slider pad-top5">
                    <div class="item">
                        <div class="reviews-rating-content">
                            <div class="rating-topbar">

                                <h3>S.C. Sarkar</h3>

                                <div class="rating-fl"><span class="star-fill"></span><span class="star-fill"></span><span class="star-fill"></span><span class="star-fill"></span><span class="star-fill"></span></div>
                            </div>
                            <p>I would like to convey my appreciation to your salesperson for her excellent back-end support and guidance. She helped me to customise the travel insurance plan for my upcoming trip to the US as per my needs. I would describe her as a patient, knowledgeable and customer-oriented person. I wish her success in life. 
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="item">
                        <div class="reviews-rating-content">
                            <div class="rating-topbar">
                                <h3>Rebecca Thomas</h3>
                                <div class="rating-fl"><span class="star-fill"></span><span class="star-fill"></span><span class="star-fill"></span><span class="star-fill"></span><span class="star-fill"></span></div>
                            </div>
                            <p>I’ve been residing in India for the past year, and I would like to say that this is the best customer service I’ve ever received in this country! Your salesperson helped me to buy travel insurance in less than 30 minutes. She spoke succinctly, gave honest answers to my queries, and didn’t request me for any irrelevant documents. Thanks for being helpful, polite and patient.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="item">
                        <div class="reviews-rating-content">
                            <div class="rating-topbar">
                                <h3>Faizaan Charania</h3>
                                <div class="rating-fl"><span class="star-fill"></span><span class="star-fill"></span><span class="star-fill"></span><span class="star-fill"></span><span class="star-gray"></span></div>
                            </div>
                            <p>I spoke with your executive in order to know more about the travel insurance plans offered by ICICI Lombard. He patiently guided me through the detailed information about the policies that was available on your website, and simultaneously explained their features. After I’d chosen a suitable plan, he also walked me through the online registration process. I appreciate the service provided.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="item">
                        <div class="reviews-rating-content">
                            <div class="rating-topbar">
                                <h3>Satindra Ahluwalia</h3>
                                <div class="rating-fl"><span class="star-fill"></span><span class="star-fill"></span><span class="star-fill"></span><span class="star-fill"></span><span class="star-gray"></span></div>
                            </div>
                            <p>I am glad that I returned to ICICI Lombard for my travel insurance purchase. Your executive provided me with efficient, personalised service in a prompt manner. She was patient and more than willing to help me choose a suitable policy. I would definitely recommend ICICI Lombard to my friends for their travel insurance needs.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="item">
                        <div class="reviews-rating-content">
                            <div class="rating-topbar">
                                <h3>Bhaskar Kumar</h3>
                                <div class="rating-fl"><span class="star-fill"></span><span class="star-fill"></span><span class="star-fill"></span><span class="star-fill"></span><span class="star-fill"></span></div>
                            </div>
                            <p>
                               Your executive got in touch with me when I was looking to buy travel insurance for my overseas trip. She helped me to understand the policy advantages like cashless hospitalisation or healthcare, and patiently guided me through the payment. I would like to thank her for being so nice and understanding.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                   
                    <div class="item">
                        <div class="reviews-rating-content">
                            <div class="rating-topbar">
                                <h3>Ritesh Kar</h3>
                                <div class="rating-fl"><span class="star-fill"></span><span class="star-fill"></span><span class="star-fill"></span><span class="star-fill"></span><span class="star-gray"></span></div>
                            </div>
                            <p>I'm happy with the services offered by ICICI Lombard. What particularly struck me was the efficient customer service. The executive in charge of helping me did a great job. Whenever I had doubts, all I had to do was call and I'd get them resolved! Simply put, a hassle-free purchase.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-12 read-reviews">
            <div class="text-center">
                <a href="/travel-insurance/customer-reviews" target="_blank" class="btn-white">Read all reviews</a>
            </div>  </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
